  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "## Changes\n* Updated dependencies\n* Moved Builder implementations back to CliInvoke from CliInvoke.Core\n* Moved primitives out of CliInvoke.Core into DotPrimitives\n* Moved ``IFilePathResolver`` into CliInvoke.Core and ``FilePathResolver`` into CliInvoke directly - Thereby allowing the removal of Resyslib.IO.Core and Resyslib.IO as dependencies\n\n## 🚀 Features\n\n- add Initial Process Timeout Support @alastairlundy (#53) - ``IProcessInvoker``, ``IProcessFactory``, ``ProcessInvoker``, and ``ProcessFactory`` have been updated to support this.\n- Added method ProcessConfiguration supporting method overloads for ``ContinueWhenExitAsync``, ``ContinueWhenBufferedExitAsync``, and ``ContinueWhenPipedAsync`` to `IProcessInvoker``, ``IProcessFactory``, ``ProcessInvoker``, and ``ProcessFactory``",
